{"lines":[{"c":1,"y":0.033290688745513108,"x":0.11516562475135431,"h":0.013360482924678174,"t":"Test 1","w":0.059792207082112636},{"w":0.17901233673095707,"t":"Questions 35-40","y":0.07979976436460734,"h":0.01472320376914027,"c":1,"x":0.11316872800797829},{"x":0.11097846560807388,"t":"Look at the following statements (Questions 35-40) and the list of people below.","y":0.11606380017876039,"w":0.76157485961914073,"h":0.020169237898432391,"c":1},{"y":0.15114034347189653,"t":"Match each statement with the correct person, A, B or C.","x":0.11092961238332905,"w":0.54355036417643232,"h":0.020990778335553295,"c":1},{"y":0.18749999983781107,"w":0.68724278767903646,"x":0.11111111623507024,"h":0.017446996466431108,"t":"Write the correct letter, A, B or C, in boxes 35-40 on your answer sheet.","c":1},{"t":"NB You may use any letter more than once.","y":0.22205250633917595,"x":0.11096626454732653,"h":0.017922691799024504,"c":1,"w":0.42829025268554688},{"y":0.25696153022279478,"h":0.019670434778795265,"w":0.65462524414062506,"t":"35 Greater levels of automation will not result in lower employment.","c":1,"x":0.11096539162373668},{"h":0.01957697694237015,"x":0.10896265973528946,"t":"36 There are several reasons why Al is appealing to businesses.","y":0.28469083985395272,"w":0.63187616984049488,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"37","x":0.10905349746667056,"y":0.31249999982298537,"w":0.026748971939086902,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"c":1,"h":0.023468711772150375,"t":"Al's potential to transform people's lives has parallels with major cultural shifts","x":0.15413509762748656,"w":0.74111338297526042,"y":0.31018380945455526},{"c":1,"t":"which occurred in previous eras.","w":0.31150942484537769,"h":0.021088560843495752,"x":0.15602995345991658,"y":0.32866896884970032},{"w":0.68157516479492186,"t":"38 It is important to be aware of the range of problems that Al causes.","y":0.35517213095215416,"c":1,"h":0.023344639754548147,"x":0.10881641476294533},{"y":0.38448558408703315,"c":1,"x":0.10893994563288137,